  SDisplayMapping1cb25dc8002d = 'Conservative detection/review pack for Delphi PDF, document, and imaging component libraries. Image/PDF viewers and editors are feature-rich controls with platform, codec, printing, and licensing concerns, so this pack reports them and preserves only clearly nonvisual helper components with review.';
